MIND-MODULES-1 (2026-11-08): q08-mind imports local JSON data modules.
The canonical /ops/deploy path fetches worker.js from GitHub and PUTs it through
PUT /accounts/{account}/workers/scripts/{name}/content, which does not bundle
JSON modules; the upload fails with "No such module" or error 10162
("unsupported Content-Type application/json"). The dedicated mind-deploy.yml
workflow bundles these JSON modules with pinned Wrangler before uploading, so
q08-mind ships through that workflow instead of canonical-deploy.yml.
